& [IR4RuntimeBoundaryImportAndInvariantReconciliationV1] is the IR4-S01 boundary map for LangGraph proof runtime planning
  + [boundary_map_id] is ir4-runtime-boundary-import-and-invariant-reconciliation-v1
  + [boundary_map_uuid] is d678cf40-3c4e-47c6-9024-d7dc77aa0a88
  + [slice_id] is IR4-S01
  + [source_chunk] is IR4 LangGraph proof runtime implementation
  + [authority_scope] is imported runtime contracts, imported operator harness proof, graph/checkpoint non-authority invariants, operator handoff obligations, stale triggers, and forbidden mutation boundaries
  + [implementation_scope] is boundary import and invariant reconciliation only
  + [model_route_used] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: import accepted runtime and operator-harness boundaries before defining implementation contracts
  = must: preserve LangGraph checkpoint state and graph state as execution state only
  = must: require operator_trace or equivalent trace evidence for every graph path before future surface consumption
  = must: keep SOP-first interrupt when authority-sensitive conditions exceed mechanical runtime certainty
  - never: implement executable graph code, install dependencies, create checkpoints, create fixtures, mutate source authority, authorize operations control, or authorize live machine control in this slice

